From bba6e2c6996e01fc35f12ec6a460e75f8f8b6d29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:46:20 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed player right-click menu

Rebuilds the player right-click menu as in the redesign: Play or Pause, Stop, Previous Item, Next Item and Record with their current hotkeys shown, Hide UI for the minimal view, the Playback, Video, Audio and Subtitle submenus (greyed out without media), then More Settings (the Tools menu), a Playlist submenu for the play queue, Open Media and Quit VLC. Every entry uses the two-tone orange menu icons exported from the Figma file. The skins interface keeps VLC's original layout.
